usage: profile.py [-h] {inventory,warm,run,analyze} ...

Profile the existing CGO-disabled nomicrophone hermetic lane. Heavy commands
are opt-in and fail closed without dedicated-runner evidence.

positional arguments:
  {inventory,warm,run,analyze}
    inventory           discover the six hermetic module package inventories
    warm                download dependencies and compile test binaries
                        without running tests
    run                 capture one full inventory trial or an exact two-
                        repeat cohort
    analyze             analyze retained raw JSON/stderr completely offline

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
